# 3-bed / 2-bath with a hallway spine — the classic barndo split: open
# living/kitchen/dining up front, a full-width hall feeding the bedrooms.
# Two secondary beds share the hall bath; the primary suite gets its own
# ensuite and walk-in. Each bedroom has its own closet (with a door); the
# two baths sit back-to-back on a shared wet wall.
plan "Birch Hollow"
envelope 68 x 32
ceiling 10
program 3 bed 2 bath

# --- public band (south, y 0..15) ---
room living:  living  at 0,0   size 26 x 15
room kitchen: kitchen at 26,0  size 20 x 15
room dining:  dining  at 46,0  size 22 x 15

# --- the spine ---
room hall: hallway at 0,15 size 68 x 3

# --- secondary bedrooms + shared bath (west) ---
room bed1:    bedroom  at 0,18   size 13 x 14
room closet1: closet   at 13,18  size 4 x 14
room bed2:    bedroom  at 17,18  size 13 x 14
room closet2: closet   at 30,18  size 4 x 14
room bath1:   bathroom at 34,18  size 8 x 14

# --- primary suite (east): ensuite backs onto the shared bath (wet wall) ---
room mbath:   bathroom at 42,18  size 6 x 14
room master:  bedroom  at 48,18  size 14 x 14
room mcloset: closet   at 62,18  size 6 x 14

open living - kitchen width 10
open kitchen - dining width 10
open living - hall width 4
door hall - bed1 width 3
door hall - bed2 width 3
door hall - bath1 width 2.67
door hall - master width 3
door bed1 - closet1 width 2.5
door bed2 - closet2 width 2.5
door master - mbath width 2.67
door master - mcloset width 2.5

entry living south width 3 offset 20
window living south width 10 offset 2
window kitchen south width 8 offset 6
window dining south width 8 offset 6
window bed1 north width 5 offset 4
window bed2 north width 5 offset 4
window master north width 6 offset 6
window bath1 north width 3 offset 2
window mbath north width 3 offset 1
